ne":null,"path":null,"review_id":5609794746},{"body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### \ud83d\udd35 Needs a closer look\n\nCross-version asynchronous completion and transaction lifecycle behavior warrant human verification beyond the available source-level evidence.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>1 open issue</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Low severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Remove @&ZeroWidthSpace;Nullable annotations from test helper](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/pull/20793#discussion_r4350007722) \u00b7 New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>1 resolved since last review</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Classify failed transaction results or remove the capability claim](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/pull/20793#discussion_r4344691513)\n</details>\n\n<sub>Review effort: Balanced</sub>","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5616374009","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5616374009},{"body":"[Testing] The repository's Java style guidance explicitly excludes `@Nullable` annotations from test code. Remove these two annotations and the unused `javax.annotation.Nullable` import; callers can still pass null to this test helper.","comment_commit_id":"ba76dd7fea266c5888de6ac1d6a816de42a241dd","comment_id":4350007722,"key":"inline:4350007722","kind":"inline","line":669,"original_commit_id":"ba76dd7fea266c5888de6ac1d6a816de42a241dd","original_line":669,"path":"instrumentation/lettuce/lettuce-5.1/testing/src/main/java/io/opentelemetry/instrumentation/lettuce/v5_1/AbstractLettuceSyncClientTest.java","review_commit_id":"ba76dd7fea266c5888de6ac1d6a816de42a241dd","review_id":5616374009,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-22T15:07:00Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"741c321c7cbfe686c36e997d109ea547972240d889599a182b5171f96a34b2a0","id":4350007722,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:07:00Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86vP_CB"}],"frozen_at":1792721852,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-23T02:17:32Z","frozen_sha":"ba76dd7fea266c5888de6ac1d6a816de42a241dd","head_ref":"copilot/trask-align-lettuce-5-1-redis-error-prefixes","head_repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","head_repo_id":210933087,"input_mode":"direct","launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":39888749284},"loop_kind":"copilot_review","metadata":{"body":"<!--\nCHANGELOG.md is generated from merged pull requests. Do not add an entry unless this PR introduces\na deprecation or breaking change.\n-->\n\nCommand-aware callbacks with a directly exposed Redis server reply use its first nonempty ASCII-space-delimited token verbatim for `error.type` on spans and duration metrics. For example, `WRONGTYPE details` produces `error.type=\"WRONGTYPE\"`.\n\nFailures supplied as exceptions use their actual exception class. Lettuce 5.x message-only failures use `_OTHER` because the tracing SPI can suppress the exception and hide the failure's origin. Successful operations omit `error.type`.\n\nEXEC result elements are not treated as failure provenance. Transaction-member failures are classified only when Lettuce exposes their own command completion; older callbacks that finish on QUEUED may not expose those errors.","title":"Align Lettuce 5.1 Redis error prefixes"},"mode":"publish","pr":20793,"pr_author_id":198982749,"protocol":"git-candidate-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1792721855,"generation":1,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"facde508b2d24a619e7a10e548ea5bb4","profile":"git-candidate-v1","required_checks":[]},"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","repo_id":210933087,"request_id":"48928c9f3dc24a26ad7c684b8912919c","schema":2,"source_private":false,"target_private":false,"workflow_ref":"review-loop-revisions/98fb6cdde0b957dd9fac1921637140b3abe6e57b","workflow_revision":"98fb6cdde0b957dd9fac1921637140b3abe6e57b"},"run":null,"schema":2,"seen_findings":["13cbd754c23c5bb263ddec30bf5c5eac9c4884abce164854cad17460bd1ccc40"],"seen_inline_findings":["079eb6204ae883901e0224128eaf04f0005826c244a0052ebe27cab9033b8206"],"seen_missed_findings":[],"stage":"dispatch_intent"}